  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Human Resources Development for Digital Innovative MSME in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to build a human resource training system in the digital industry that links industry, academia, and government in Laos, a new department will be established at the College of Commerce (CC) and a startup support center will be opened under the Ministry of Commerce, MSMEPA(MSME Promotion Agency)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the capacity of MSMEs and Supporting to foster Start-ups in Lao PDR, through establishment of a human resource training system in the digital innovation in connection with industry, academia, and government&#x25A3; SDGs &#xB2EC;&#xC131; &#xAE30;&#xC5EC;
